--[[
    AutoTrials - External Module
    Detects the active TDS trial, verifies skill + tower requirements,
    joins the trial from the lobby, and runs the matching strategy in-game.

    Dependencies (via getgenv()):
        Globals.AutoTrials  (boolean toggle, set by the GUI)

    Optional dependency (for notifications):
        getgenv().AetherWindow   -> the hub's Window object

    Exposed API:
        AutoTrials.Start()
        AutoTrials.Stop()
        AutoTrials.IsRunning()
]]

